Cell["Conclusion", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"aa1242b7-b3c1-48df-a8ef-20f742dcf0c1"],

Cell["\<\
We have modernized the GR derivation notebook using Relativity Toolkit \
v1.13.0. The use of general-purpose routines for symbolic differentiation and \
tensor formatting makes the derivation more transparent and easier to \
maintain.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"466e6454-3427-4b03-b06b-1717b5266834"]
